if mibBuilder.loadTexts: clcrAPIfBeaconEnabled.setDescription("This object specifies the option to enable or disable\n                the beacon measurement request info IE.\n                - A value of 'true' indicate that the \n                LWAPP APs broadcast radio measurement request\n                messages that include a beacon measurement \n                request information element to clients \n                compatible with CCX versions 2 and\n                above.\n\n                - A value of false indicates that the global\n                configuration at network level takes\n                higher precedence if clcrAPIfOverrideGlobal is\n                set to 'false'.  Radio measurement frames include \n                a beacon request information element for every\n                channel over which the measurement needs\n                to be performed.  The measurement requests are\n                repeated at every interval configured through\n                clcrAPIfBeaconInterval. ")
